OL,3,GNEWSAVandals wreak havoc at new
OL,4,Acommunity garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community garden created by
OL,7,Fvolunteers has been damaged by
OL,8,F"mindless vandals".
OL,10,FReading Borough Council staff gave up
OL,11,Ftheir time over four days last week to
OL,12,Fcreate the first stage of the new
OL,13,Fgarden near the town's Civic Centre.
OL,15,FBut early on Monday, two men attempted
OL,16,Fto burn plants, damaged pots and pulled
OL,17,Fa tree out of the ground. One of them
OL,18,Furinated on the garden before they
OL,19,Fleft.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
